    // 1. test_load_all_finds_golden_copies — loads metadata from golden/ dir
    // 2. test_create_working_copy — creates temp dir with database copy
    // 3. test_verify_hash_matches — SHA-256 matches known good hash
    // 4. test_verify_hash_mismatch — detects tampered file
    // 5. test_missing_golden_file — returns clear error for missing .db
    // 6. test_missing_checksum_file — handles missing checksums.sha256
    // 7. test_metadata_parsing — loads JSON metadata correctly
    // 8. test_working_copy_isolation — two working copies don't interfere
}
```

### Module: workload.rs (Workload Generator)
```rust
#[cfg(test)]
mod workload_tests {
    // 1. test_determinism_same_seed — same seed produces identical sequence
    // 2. test_determinism_different_seed — different seed produces different sequence
    // 3. test_operation_mix_ratios — 50/30/20 mix within 5% tolerance over 10K ops
    // 4. test_concurrent_distribution — N threads get non-overlapping ID ranges
    // 5. test_update_targets_valid — UPDATEs only target previously INSERTed rows
    // 6. test_delete_targets_valid — DELETEs only target existing (not yet deleted) rows
    // 7. test_empty_workload — 0 operations returns empty vec
    // 8. test_single_operation — 1 operation works correctly
    // 9. test_large_workload — 100K operations without OOM
    // 10. test_transaction_wrapping — operations correctly grouped in BEGIN/COMMIT
    // 11. test_barrier_points — concurrent batches have explicit sync points
    // 12. test_schema_aware_generation — INSERT columns match table schema
}
```

### Module: comparison.rs (FrankenSQLite vs C SQLite Comparison)
