    // 4. test_value_normalization_float — f64 epsilon comparison
    // 5. test_value_normalization_text — string comparison
    // 6. test_value_normalization_blob — byte comparison
    // 7. test_logical_comparison_sorted — row-level comparison sorted by PK
    // 8. test_backend_error_handling — one backend fails, other succeeds
