## Implementation Notes (bd-so1h)

The implementation was completed but lost due to concurrent edits. Here's what needs to be done:

### 1. In codegen_insert() (codegen.rs:1911)

After opening the table cursor, add:

```rust
// OpenWrite for each index (bd-so1h: Phase 5I.3)
#[allow(clippy::cast_possible_wrap, clippy::cast_possible_truncation)]
